{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14529","headline":"奉酬卢端公饮後赠诸公见示之作 · 戴叔伦","name":"奉酬卢端公饮後赠诸公见示之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佐幕临戎旌斾间，五营无事万家闲。\n风吹杨柳渐拂地，日映楼台欲下山。\n绮席昼开留上客，朱门半掩拟重关。\n当时不敢辞先醉，误逐羣公倒载还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}